# Ultra-Light-Fast-Generic-Face-Detector-1MB NCNN

Source: https://github.com/Linzaer/Ultra-Light-Fast-Generic-Face-Detector-1MB

Imported commit: dffdddda9794a50607cba8f318507a28c1c27cab

License: MIT, see `LICENSE`.

Scope:

- Only the NCNN C++ wrapper is vendored here.  The `version-RFB/RFB-320` model
  files are not redistributed in this repository; see `docs/MODEL_ASSETS.md`.
- The full training, MNN, TFLite, Caffe, OpenCV-DNN and evaluation trees are
  intentionally not vendored.
- This project uses the model as a board-test candidate at 320x240 input.
